c… And when python just isn’t an option, I have done my share of php, javascript, objective-c and so on.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Recently I started thinking that I should probably expand my programming knowledge a bit to make myself more marketable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>